    dct:title "MAESTRO HHM-Core" ;
    rdfs:label "MAESTRO HHM-Core"@en ;
    dct:description "A version of the MAESTRO manufacturing ontology structured after the HHM-Core v1 reference model: product, physical resources, skills, recipe and planning, safety and policy, invocation hooks and minimal execution, with modules for telemetry, energy, maintenance and manufacturing as a service, and extensions for data formats, the digital twin, OPC UA, ISA-88, ISA-95, AutomationML, DTDL, REST, MQTT, DDS, Modbus, PROFINET, EtherCAT, PROV-O and ODRL."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "All terms share the namespace https://w3id.org/maestro# (prefix maestro); rdfs:isDefinedBy names the module that defines each term. Definitions are reused from MAESTRO 1.0 wherever a matching term exists (dct:source per term). Standards are referenced only where their ontology design pattern or schema is pinned under references/ in the MAESTRO repository; ECLASS, DPP, PRONTO, CaSkMan, AAS, OpenAPI, SAREF4INMA and XACML are named as hooks and carry no IRIs and no mappings. This file is the merged form of all modules in one document."@en ;
    dct:creator "Melwin Xavier" ;
    dct:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> ;
    dct:modified "2026-09-30"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:source <https://github.com/melwinxavier/MAESTRO> ;
